WEBVTT

00:11:59.787 --> 00:12:02.037
Systems are all around us --

00:12:02.662 --> 00:12:05.537
schools, governments, health care.

00:12:06.912 --> 00:12:09.537
Could those systems
become more trustworthy

00:12:09.537 --> 00:12:12.079
through the use
of the tools in the toolbox?

00:12:13.412 --> 00:12:14.746
I don't see why not.

00:12:15.496 --> 00:12:20.537
So if you are designing any system,
but especially an ecosystem,

00:12:20.537 --> 00:12:22.246
give those tools a try.

00:12:23.412 --> 00:12:24.579
If you do that,

00:12:24.579 --> 00:12:28.537
I can almost guarantee
the Force will be with you.

00:12:29.329 --> 00:12:30.454
Trust me.